WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.790
Have you heard? The campaign has become a landslide!

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.790
I'd never have believed this could happen.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.860
They say even some SENIORS have signed!

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.930
What'll happen to members, like us?

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:15.600
What could she be thinking... Miya-sama...

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.330
Hush. Miya-sama is coming.

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:20.470
It'll be OK.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:23.610
The Sorority has the full support of the School Board.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.270
Please keep quiet!

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.290
What is it that worries you so?

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.780
You surprise me.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:50.600
Properly chosen members have nothing to worry about. Right?

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.400
But... Miya-sama!

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.880
This movement is spreading completely out of control!

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:58.290
Please try to relax.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:02.110
Our Sorority is a long-held tradition.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.820
Nothing will become of this.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.260
So, listen, everyone.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:17.020
Let's discuss the opera we're presenting next week.

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:22.720
<b>31. The Bad Apple</b>

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:30.850
C'mon! Class is starting!

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:43.540
Hayashida-san, Kiryu-san!

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:47.600
Say... Nakaya-san...

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:50.810
Would you let us sign your sheet?

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.890
What! How can you say that, Hayashida-san!

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:56.100
You are all Sorority members, aren't you?

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:59.190
If you sign, you'll be kicked out!

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.280
We don't care about that.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:07.180
When you needed us... we weren't any help to you, Junko...

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:16.360
Please let me have your resignation before the week is out.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.650
Please, Kiryu-san, Hayashida-san, help me!

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.800
You all can testify that I really did have a fever during exams. Please!

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:42.390
Since then, we've had our doubts about the Sorority...

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.200
We're sorry, Junko!

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.630
Forgive us, Junko!

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:50.280
I never blamed you! Never!

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.260
Junko! <b> </b>

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.600
Junko! Junko!

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.590
My Dear Brother...

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:04.640
"Substantial"... that's the word I'd choose, I think.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:07.660
Our school's complexion has undergone a substantial change.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:19.620
I'm off to do petition work... so see you tomorrow!

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.050
Bye! See you later!

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.160
Kiryu-san, Hayashida-san...

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.700
We'd like to have a word with you.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.830
Come along with us, please.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:34.360
OK.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.650
What on earth do you mean by this?

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:47.730
You signed! And you are members!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.200
It's unbelievable!

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:52.690
We... we will resign.

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.700
Yes, we'll resign.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:00.540
It would appear you underestimate us.

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.490
If we allow such things to happen,

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:05.170
...how can we maintain any order in the Sorority?!

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:09.300
Not another word!

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.010
This kind of behavior... is unbecoming.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.870
Miya-sama! But...

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:22.530
Whoever wants to sign, can sign.

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.590
Leave them alone.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:25.990
You two, on the other hand,

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:30.150
...shall, of course, be expelled from the Sorority.

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:33.360
And, we will take all records of your membership,

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.700
...and erase them forever.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:38.580
Understood?

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.680
The way things are going, the Sorority is in great danger.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:14.160
If... if the Sorority is abolished,

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.100
...what will become of us?

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:18.360
We'll lose everything.

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.400
The lavish parties and tea ceremonies,

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.880
...the opulent seasonal celebrations,

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:26.630
...designated reserved seats at the cafeteria and library,

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.980
...and the envious eyes of the lower classes...

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.790
All of this will be taken away from us!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.950
So... tell me.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:36.620
Mm?

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.230
How is Miya-sama?

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:43.160
Miya-sama is as resolute as always,

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.100
...and I have the utmost respect for her as head of the Sorority...

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:47.980
But... <b> </b>

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:48.850
But... "But"?

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:52.530
...there are times I just cannot figure her out.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:56.850
Just between you and me... I feel the same way!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:57.930
You, too?

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:00.140
Yes, sometimes...

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.230
Not taking action against those who abandon the Sorority is admirable,

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:07.380
...but this movement is becoming so widespread!

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.130
Can she preserve the Sorority by maintaining such an attitude?

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:12.000
It's not going to be easy.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:15.940
After all, look at how this all started.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:20.160
It was because she had to have that girl, Misonoo Nanako, in the Sorority!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:23.490
And there's the way she treats her, too.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:25.030
There's something strange there.

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:28.510
I wonder what it is...

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:31.260
...the thing between her and Misonoo Nanako.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.010
Could we...

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.700
Sure, it's OK.

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:42.080
Shall we sit together?

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.540
Um... sure.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.490
11 people in one hour, this morning.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.770
Good progress! Good!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:56.110
Shall we take a break?

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.180
OK.

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.770
Look what time it is!

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:02.110
My first class is PE. I have to run!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.990
OK, see you later!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.340
Misonoo-san...

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:17.030
Mona Lisa-no-Kimi...!

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:21.170
No need to look so frightened.

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:24.490
I just wanted to ask you something.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.630
What is it between you and Miya-sama?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:29.110
Like I said before, I don't know...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.150
I can't make any sense of it.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:36.700
Why was Miya-sama so insistent on having you as a member?

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:40.180
Surely you MUST know something.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.090
I... I really don't know!

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.250
That's a lie.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:45.660
It's the truth!

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.670
I don't know anything.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.420
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.890
Excuse me. My class is starting.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:02.910
My Dear Brother...

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:05.550
...when she asked me that time,

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:07.230
...I had no idea why Mona-Lisa-no-Kimi

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.910
...would want to know about Miya-sama and myself.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:14.460
I knew nothing of the dark suspicion within her.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:18.420
It was... it was all a mystery to me.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:22.920
But... no matter what... I couldn't have told her.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.960
This whole matter of my admission into the Sorority...

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.440
..even though it was based on misunderstanding,

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.450
...about my relationship with you, my brother,

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.390
...and the matter of Miya-sama,

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.740
I can't ever tell anyone! How could I!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.870
There has to be something!

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.150
Something between Miya-sama and Misonoo-san.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:46.560
Some kind of secret they have to keep hidden.

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:49.440
Yes. And that is Miya-sama's weak point.

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:52.700
We have to find out as quickly as possible.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:56.900
Yes. Then we can force Miya-sama to reconsider,

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:59.110
...and she will save the Sorority.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.450
Shall we do it? We must.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:04.050
This is the time to act.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.120
Yes. It is.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.320
What happened?

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.540
There is no other way.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.110
This is for the good of the Sorority.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:23.540
If we should fail... the consequences are terrible.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.480
Perhaps also if we succeed.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:26.480
What?

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.430
If we expose Miya-sama's weakness,

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:31.240
...and her position as head of the Sorority becomes untenable,

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:34.260
...so that she cannot continue... then what?

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:36.540
If that should happen,

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:39.690
...Ogiwara-san or Komabayashi-san could easily take her place.

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.540
Oh... Miya-sama!

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.710
I'm sorry.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.760
It suits you well, Ogiwara-san.

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:31.310
The chair of the Sorority leader.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.700
I'm so sorry...!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:41.490
We'll have an emergency meeting this afternoon.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.830
Please see that all the members are informed.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.220
Very well.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.050
Excuse me.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.570
Your attention please.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:21.000
All Sorority members please meet at the Sorority house.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.770
I repeat,

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:28.500
All Sorority members please meet at the Sorority house.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.240
I regret to have to tell you this...

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:37.800
We have a bad apple within our Sorority.

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:46.930
To prevent the whole tree from being ruined,

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:49.510
...this bad apple must be removed.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:54.320
I'll not make a big scene.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:58.230
Please turn in your resignation immediately.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.310
You know who you are.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:07.690
That is all.

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:25.120
How did this happen?

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:27.260
Who was it? Who?

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.190
Who leaked the plan to Miya-sama?

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:30.960
It must be one of us!

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:34.930
It has to be one of us, because no one else knows!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.020
Yamamoto-san...

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:44.460
You've always been so anxious to please Miya-sama, haven't you...

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.100
What do you mean by that?

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.810
Stop pretending.

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:49.160
There's no call for that!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.770
She would never do such a thing.

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:52.810
Really? Who, then?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.000
I don't know.

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:56.900
Don't you?

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:56.910
What do you mean by that? <b> </b>
Don't you?

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:57.800
What do you mean by that? <b> </b>

00:14:57.920 --> 00:14:59.030
What do you mean by that? What do you THINK I mean?

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:00.440
Stop it!

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.200
Accusations won't do any good anymore.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:10.080
Fools. We were all fools.

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.080
To think that we could deceive Miya-sama.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:16.410
Yes. Compared to Miya-sama, you are...

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.720
...well, let's just say there is no comparison.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:18.860
What was that!
...well, let's just say there is no comparison.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:19.970
What was that!

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:29.570
Stop all this fighting!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:31.060
Are you OK?

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.790
Is this... is this what you want?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:38.400
After all your criticism of Miya-sama? Look at yourself!

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.260
Wait! Yamamoto-san!

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:47.500
We'll just pretend we don't know anything about it.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:49.580
It's up to you, now.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:01.060
Fools. Such fools.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:04.640
Do they really imagine the Sorority will let them stay?

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.850
As far as the bad apples,

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.830
...no doubt Miya-sama already knows who they are.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:12.490
No, I can't! Leaving the Sorority -- the thought of it is just too terrible!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.300
Get a grip on yourself.

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:15.570
It's not over yet!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:16.100
What?

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:17.770
It's Misonoo Nanako...

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.730
She's the key -- we must know her secret.

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.300
This is our last stand.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.140
We will be defeated,

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:31.380
...or Miya-sama herself will be defeated!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:47.130
Yes, Misonoo residence.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.390
I'm sorry for calling so unexpectedly.

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:52.280
Mona-Lisa-no-Kimi?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.980
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.050
A favor?

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:56.800
Yes.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:17:01.850
The seniors are now discussing the future of the Sorority.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:05.300
I've given the matter a lot of thought,

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.690
...and have come to believe that the Sorority's credibility is ruined beyond repair.

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:09.710
That being the case,

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:12.590
...I am prepared to abolish the Sorority.

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:16.300
But not everyone is convinced.

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:20.620
As a former member, could you speak to them?

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:22.760
Me? Surely not me!

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:26.210
Yes, you! No one else will do.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.790
But... but...!

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.550
So, I'll wait for you there.

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:37.950
My Dear Brother...

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:41.840
Mona-Lisa-sama's request was like a dream come true to me.

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:48.040
But... but could I really convince the senior members?

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:54.860
Hello?

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:57.640
Kaoru-no-Kimi?

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:13.080
Um... where are the other members?

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.040
They're inside.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.510
Please go in.

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:33.580
Mona-Lisa-no-Kimi! What's going on?

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.950
Welcome, Misonoo-san.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.090
Borgia-no-Kimi!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.670
You are so naive!

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:48.980
We would never want to abolish the Sorority!

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:52.120
We're sorry, Misonoo-san.

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:55.220
But there's something we have to know.

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:58.340
You have to tell us the secret between you and Miya-sama.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:01.370
Tell us. Please tell us!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.910
How... how could I?

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.500
It has nothing to do with you.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.970
It has EVERYTHING to do with us.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.610
This secret between you and her... we have to know what it is.

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:15.810
If you don't tell us, we are in danger!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.480
All of us...!

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:20.180
Please, let me go!

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.710
You needn't be so frightened.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:57.460
Until just recently, you were one of us.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:19:59.680
You were a Sorority member.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:02.390
I didn't approve of you as a member.

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:07.530
But, I tolerated you, and treated you like the other members.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.720
I taught you party etiquette.

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:14.030
I taught you flower arranging.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.810
I helped you prepare for the exams.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:20.310
And sometimes... I would even smile at you.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.540
Like this.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:27.800
Just because Miya-sama favored you.

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:32.060
There is something between Miya-sama and you!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:38.370
It's too late to claim you know nothing!

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:40.850
Well? Tell us!

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:42.910
Please stop!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:44.860
I won't let you go.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:53.840
We can't escape either.

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:57.160
Tell us!

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:59.320
I don't know. I know nothing!

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:00.590
That CAN'T be true!

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:03.780
What can I say to satisfy you?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:04.760
The truth!

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.350
Miya-sama's secret!

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:09.060
Stop, Ogiwara-san. You'll fall! Watch out!

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:10.460
Come on, hurry!

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.420
Watch out!

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:53.000
Now... Ogiwara-san...

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:56.420
This is the end... for us.

00:21:57.430 --> 00:21:59.360
This is just too awful to bear.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:03.240
I can't stand it!

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:08.610
No! No, no! No! No...!

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:09.290
No...!

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:29.430
I'm sorry. I'm late.

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.280
I got lost and couldn't find my way here.

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:49.070
My Dear Brother...

00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:56.120
Borgia-sama and Mona-Lisa-sama, both of them,

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:00.590
...were nice "big sisters", always taking care of junior members.

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:04.120
But they became cornered... desperate...

00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:09.130
...they changed... so much...

00:23:15.300 --> 00:23:16.350
My Dear Brother...

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:20.670
I'm collecting signatures to abolish the Sorority.

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:27.460
I only want to abolish the Sorority itself.

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:30.210
Please believe me...

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:35.990
I am not doing this to hurt individual members.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.070
And yet, my dear brother...

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:44.070
it seems what I'm doing is the cause of some distress.

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:48.460
That hurts me deeply.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
